[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:31. Where's Sally]
[00:00.460]Lesson 31. | 第31課。
[00:03.115]Where's Sally, Jack? | 薩利在哪兒，傑克？
[00:06.720]She's in the garden, Jean. | 她在花園裡，吉恩。
[00:09.670]What is she doing? | 她在幹什麼？
[00:11.755]She's sitting under the tree. | 她坐在樹下。
[00:14.345]Is Tim in the garden too? | 蒂姆也在花園裡嗎？
[00:17.550]Yes, he is. | 是的，他在。
[00:19.490]He's climbing the tree. | 他正在爬樹。
[00:21.785]I beg your pardon? | 請再說一遍。
[00:24.100]Who is climbing the tree? | 誰在爬樹？
[00:26.505]Tim is. | 蒂姆在爬。
[00:28.260]What about the dog? | 狗呢？
[00:30.530]The dog's in the garden too. | 狗也在花園裡。
[00:33.245]It's running across the grass. | 它正在草地上奔跑。
[00:36.110]It's running after a cat. | 它正在追一隻貓。